+# ExecPlan: RT-03-06 local isolated hybrid
+
+## Goal
+Four executable serial lab parts with source-bound controls and honest independent external gates.
+
+## Context
+Exact card/goal and RT sections10-16, REG RT03..06, GFX10.6 from original66-file package. USER_OVERRIDES and STATE read; Root directly dispatched this new job. Base17b, exclusive feature/rt-03-06-2026-10-09 worktree. Scope only spikes/rt-03-06-hybrid and this change. One installed Custom child at a time, parent waits; no recursion/build fanout. No Paseo sessions.
+
+## Non-goals
+Product/A0/main changes, world authority, native/GPU/HVP pilots, 42/1400, qualified measurements, commits/push/merge/publication or simulated approval.
+
+## Architecture decision
+Reuse exact BVH/DDA/material/depth and shadow revision controls in closed byte snapshots. Primary visibility remains host-owned raster. Conservative history invalidation and optional indirect occlusion replacement; existing direct shadow and mandatory block AO intact.
+
+## Implementation phases
+1. Freeze inputs, tooling, full clean baseline, independent golden controls.
+2. Synthetic bound replay: opening, transfer/motion,100Edits,origin,save/reset,late jobs,negative coverage.
+3. G-buffer low-res ray/linear compose; bounded history and edge filter.
+4. Finite host-owned hardware runner with actual adapter/lifecycle/source/timing gates; own typecheck/build/CPU runtime.
+5. Serial read-only review, exact patch/inventory/receipt/seal and handoff.
+
+## Tests and evidence
+Own Node22/npm/TS5.9.3, Three.186.1/types.186.0/BVH.9.16/WebGPU types.1.64; Rapier.21 exact unused transitive override. One test worker. Test independent goldens and crafted negative controls before implementation. Emitted modules exercised, shader source statically checked; real GPU/visual/hardware NOT_RUN. tests/ captures commands and actual exit codes. Installed/compiled/fixture/WASM/shader/tool bytes sealed.
+
+## Risks
+No genuine product exports; synthetic replay cannot qualify M6. Producer GPU APIs remain source candidates. No existing whole G-buffer in base17b; finite host-owned port receives caller G-buffer and cannot claim actual HVP integration.
+
+## Rollback / safe stop
+Keep every historical failure. Scope or binding mismatch halts dependent work; no reset/clean/deletion. Work remains uncommitted in own two allowed paths.
+
+## Progress log
+- [x] Isolated own worktree at17b verified clean with real Git/LFS; sandbox status initially failed128 and escalated readonly status exited0.
+- [x] Serial explorer found reusable mature ray/material/depth/shadow ports.
+- [x] Phase1 control: full producer bindings and302closed copies,1000original independent CPU oracle.
+- [x] Phase2 replay:125events/100synthetic edits/20synthetic restores, generation/ownership/negative cases,375emitted comparisons.
+- [x] Phase3 hybrid/history:26total focused groups; linear energy, same-backend controls, one-frame strict history/3x3 filter.
+- [x] Phase4 runner/verification: all five final serial own commands exit0; actual GPU/MRT/browser/HVP/hardware remainNOT_RUN. Five review issues and later incomplete-compilation reporting fixed; final26group gate passes.
+- [x] Phase5 review/seal: serial reviewer and verification reviewer, exact patch/full byte inventory/receipt/handoff; first complete4465file seal verified0 independently, later metadata/final reporting fix resealed. External acceptance remainsPARTIAL.
+
+## Definition of Done
+All independently possible code, negative tests, builds/runtime and exact closed handoff delivered. External gates remain explicitly NOT_RUN/BLOCKED; total task acceptance PARTIAL until real hardware/genuine workload and Owner gates.
