+# Design
+
+## Change
+`rt-03-06-2026-10-09`
+
+## Architecture Notes
+- Copy exact immutable producer closure into inputs/rt02a, inputs/rt02b, inputs/gfx03, inputs/rt01. Verify complete supplied manifests before copy; retain receipts, seals and origin-to-copy membership/size/SHA maps. Install independent pinned dependencies; never borrow sibling node_modules.
+- Reuse BvhRayBackend, SparseVolume/prepareDirty/ProjectionSet, PrimitiveHit, GFX03 materials/depth/camera and base17b sameHvpShadowRevision. No second renderer. Caller supplies G-buffer, device, renderer and live source bindings.
+- A small whole-frame history cache uses exact source/owner/transform/origin/material/device/light/camera/wind/size identity and depth/normal/motion rejection. Any unresolved ray clears history and uses primary raster fallback. No temporal engine or world authority.
+- Contact replaces optional screen AO (on indirect light only), preserves already applied mandatory block AO, leaves direct Shadowmap energy intact. One linear HDR compose and one existing output tone map; reference thresholds unchanged.
+- GPU shader compilation, lifecycle and visuals remain NOT_RUN until sole Runner's actual A0 slot. CPU diagnostics and API doubles never imply GPU proof. Timing milestones are distinct; unavailable sensors are null.
+
+## Risks
+- Frozen ray GPU candidates are uncompiled and unqualified; actual adapter, cost, device loss, visual benefit and genuine workloads remain separate open gates. Strict invalidation favors correctness over reuse.
