+# Proposal
+
+## Change
+`rt-03-06-2026-10-09`
+
+## Problem
+- Frozen RT-02A/B CPU projections exist, but dynamic adoption, bounded contact lighting and invalidation are not yet composed or proven.
+
+## Goal
+- Deliver four serial finite lab parts: dynamic snapshot replay, low-resolution contact pass on a caller-owned raster G-buffer, conservative history/filter, and a portable finite actual-device runner. Execution is LOCAL_WINDOWS_ISOLATED; product integration NO.
+- Preserve RT-01's eight analytical and one RD synthetic fixtures and 1000 ray tuples, Native 4/6, helper 10/12, RAY02/03 FAIL and GFX03 visual/backend FAIL at 0.2 percent. No real HVP cut/Save or A0 M2 export is supplied.
