+## Sources and controls
+
+`import-rt.mjs` verifies the frozen RT-01 receipt/seal/manifest and all 49 payloads before idempotent import. `imported/rt01/import-manifest.json` binds every source/target path, size and digest, including original DDA, independent brute force, validation and `load.mjs`. The loader changes only its fixture-root resolution. All 1000 unique numeric rays agree with both original expected results and brute force. There are eight ANALYTICAL and one RD_SYNTHETIC snapshots, zero PRODUCT_EXPORT. Original mesh/camera/ray bytes are preserved.
