+`import-hvp.mjs` copies nine exact Git-object snapshots: actual fixed-base HVP `visualEffects.ts` and its original tests; historical RD11 backend/control, RD14 material/wind and hardened oracle-v2 plus RESULTS. The historical R&D repository is a separate isolated Git clone, not the main repository's object database. `imported/source-manifest.json` binds both commits and identifies modified ports. Imported originals are not compiled in place or rewritten.
