+The three fixtures retain original F00 mesh buffers and near camera, adding labelled ANALYTICAL hard-AO seam, alpha/wind decor and water depth probes. AO is an explicit analytical fixture attribute; this does not re-run the product terrain mesher. Water is a stationary planar sheet with explicit single-pass/front/back/opaque-depth policy. The volume candidate is a bounded transparent optical layer, not raymarching atmosphere or a claim of volumetric water integration.
