+## Reusable boundary
+
+`src/materials.ts::surfaceMaterial/sky` are small WebGL/TSL candidates, not a renderer tree. `src/port.ts::loadPort` supplies verified copies of material, mesh, camera and source data. `windInputs` retains the RD14 stable cluster/tick/owner-local response. `createDepthCameraPort` supplies immutable source/matrix metadata and a borrowed native depth texture; the host owns texture lifetime and epoch. Consumers must invalidate the borrow after resize, scene/material/owner change or dispose. Main owns the renderer/loop; ATM/RT consumers may reuse the functions and input port but do not gain source/save authority. A0/S1 must bind actual current HVP closure before adoption.
