+Thresholds were not loosened: channel epsilon1, changed whole-frame fraction≤0.002 and each 8×8 tile fraction≤0.005, blank/malformed captures rejected. WebGPU presented-texture orientation/readback defects introduced by the initial port were fixed and the original failed artifacts retained. Remaining version/backend differences are visible to this oracle and require the real HVP material/visual gate, not an automatic new Golden.
