+# RT-01 handoff
+
+Read `README.md`, then run `spikes/rt-01-oracle/repro.ps1` from this worktree. This is a finite CPU profile and needs no A0 native/GPU slot. It uses original product control source from base `17b1db4201a28e7b607c30707bdc2b75e3484a10`, immutable imported R&D bytes, and a pinned installed compiler read-only.
+
+## Consumer entry points
+
+Use the immutable shared version `spikes/_shared/rt-2026-10-09/v1`. Manifest SHA256: `bc6e9be728c932b0fe6f88ea2d6024f61b2b53bc59d47aae0e941c499a34dbea`. Start with `rays/golden-1000.json`, `voxels/*.json/.bin`, `meshes/F00-CONTROL`, `colliders/*.json`, `cameras/presets.json`, `replay/commands.json` and `telemetry/schema.json`.
