+The final candidate is uncommitted on `feature/rt-01-2026-10-09`; exact byte inventory is in `binding-manifest.json`, with its digest in `receipt.json`. Review the complete worktree diff including untracked content against the fixed base. No commit/push/merge/publication has occurred, and no Plannotator approval is claimed. A0 must obtain real human approval for the exact final integrated diff before committing or first pushing it.
