+The recorded adapted helper population is **11/12 PASS,1FAIL, exit1**, not a green overall suite. Independent review found that its RAY03 body omitted the original positive-distance and Source-ID/Owner assertions. Its saved expected result is a miss without t: the unchanged original positive-distance assertion would FAIL. The former original5/6 interpretation was incorrect and is withdrawn. The raw11/12 file remains unchanged.
