+
+Hypothesis: the existing mature BVH traversal can preserve the entire frozen RT01 result tuple, including inside-solid hits, half-open/tied faces, unknown coverage, material/owner/cell identity and the positive-cell traversal budget. A rendered surface alone cannot supply inside/air/budget membership. Each cell therefore supplies one **non-rendered AABB proxy triangle** to MeshBVH, including air; ray queries perform exact cell-interval tests in intersected leaf ranges. This is not a Greedy-renderer bakeoff or a new presentation engine. Visible voxel occupancy is unchanged; proxy geometry never enters a render loop.
