+`runs/ray-original-red-01/report.json` reproduces the exact original package's visible F00 path in pinned Chromium/Playwright. The actual driver fragment shader contains `uvec4 sample=sourceCell(cell)` and rejects the reserved identifier. Shader/source bytes and native compiler/link facts are captured, not a string-only or CPU-DDA substitute. No linked native draw succeeds; the view is hidden and terminal. The original shader failure follows actual native allocations; no global zero-allocation-before-compiler guarantee is claimed.
