+# RT-01 handoff
+
+Read `README.md`, then run `spikes/rt-01-oracle/repro.ps1` from this worktree. This is a finite CPU profile and needs no A0 native/GPU slot. It uses original product control source from base `17b1db4201a28e7b607c30707bdc2b75e3484a10`, immutable imported R&D bytes, and a pinned installed compiler read-only.
+
+## Consumer entry points
+
+Use the immutable shared version `spikes/_shared/rt-2026-10-09/v1`. Manifest SHA256: `bc6e9be728c932b0fe6f88ea2d6024f61b2b53bc59d47aae0e941c499a34dbea`. Start with `rays/golden-1000.json`, `voxels/*.json/.bin`, `meshes/F00-CONTROL`, `colliders/*.json`, `cameras/presets.json`, `replay/commands.json` and `telemetry/schema.json`.
+
+`src/dda.mts::traceDda` and `src/bruteForce.mts::traceBruteForce` return Hit/Miss/Unknown/BudgetExceeded with distance/normal and source/material/owner information. Brute force enumerates AABBs and calls no DDA traversal helper. `load.mjs::loadFrozenVolume` is the read-only, trusted-digest/current-binding loader. Read the exact policy in README before translating these conventions to GPU queries.
+
+Pure movement changes only transform generation; the source digest stays fixed. A source cell belongs to one current owner across the transferred snapshot pair. Owner/revision/origin/material changes invalidate old projections. R&D crop exterior is Unknown. Analytical finite-region exterior is explicitly KnownEmpty. Do not relabel the analytical replay as player evidence.
+
+## Evidence and review
+
+Own change: `.devtoolbox/specs/changes/rt-01-2026-10-09`. The latest `tests/final-node22-results.json` is the authoritative scoped command/exit/log inventory; earlier raw logs are retained. `tests/source-bindings.json` verifies nine original input files against the package manifest and records the two original R&D ZIP members read. `tests/baseline-and-interruption.md` preserves initial RED/control results and the interrupted-build boundary.
+
+The final candidate is uncommitted on `feature/rt-01-2026-10-09`; exact byte inventory is in `binding-manifest.json`, with its digest in `receipt.json`. Review the complete worktree diff including untracked content against the fixed base. No commit/push/merge/publication has occurred, and no Plannotator approval is claimed. A0 must obtain real human approval for the exact final integrated diff before committing or first pushing it.
