+The DevToolbox inherited product verification reports a real MODULE_NOT_FOUND failure for product TypeScript because product node_modules are absent here. Completion preflight is advisory/degraded with canProceed=true; focused/manual evidence supports the CPU task while the original failure stays recorded. Do not pretend the original product check passed or change product verification policy in this spike.
+
+## Runner remainder
+
+No RT-01 CPU requirement depends on unavailable target hardware. Browser, GPU, visual and performance proofs belong to RT-02/RT-03 consumers and the single authorized runner. Supply this immutable version and `repro-profile.json`; do not start an HVP benchmark, 42/1400 series, or native/GPU pilot alongside other sessions. RT-01 offers CANDIDATE inputs only. Product integration, hardware acceptance and owner/art decisions remain NO/NOT_RUN.
